            <note corresp="#d1419-f1" n="18" xml:id="d1419-f1-content">
                <p>Instruction No. 3386 of July 8, 1944, and enclosed note of December 16, 1942, not
                    printed; note of July 8 printed <hi rendition="#italic">supra.</hi>
                </p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1419-f2" n="19" xml:id="d1419-f2-content">
                <p>For correspondence on these discussions, see <ref target="#pg1568">pp. 1568</ref>
